{"unit_id":"lasdrder0705__dsh-pro-vision#card-zh","repo":"lasdrder0705/dsh-pro-vision","commit":"c895e40788f6f158ccc0fa9c79aa563bb4f3a313","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pro-vision 是面向 DSH Web 的视觉桥接插件，让默认的 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 文本模型也能处理会话中的图片。它在 llm/stream 请求中识别 Pro 图片输入，调用 deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp 生成带标签的文字说明，再把说明替换图片后交给 Pro；原生视觉模型请求不会被拦截。插件还会缓存有附件 ID 的图片描述，并可配置 provider、视觉模型、文本模型、令牌上限、推理强度和缓存容量。适合希望保留 Pro 主模型、同时让它理解截图、图表或其他图片的用户；安装后需在 DSH 模型设置中声明 Pro 接受 image 输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-50","lib/bridge.js:25-45","README.md:43-55"]}
{"unit_id":"lasdrder0705__dsh-pro-vision#card-en","repo":"lasdrder0705/dsh-pro-vision","commit":"c895e40788f6f158ccc0fa9c79aa563bb4f3a313","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pro-vision lets text-only DeepSeek-V4-Pro handle images in DSH Web. It sends images to deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp, replaces them with captions, and forwards the request to Pro. Captions are cached by attachment ID. Configure the models and cache; enable image input for Pro in DSH settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-50","lib/bridge.js:25-45","README.md:43-55"]}
